WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.920
I want to take up now in Volume 16, and we're in the middle of a message that started on March the 22nd, 1924.

2
00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:23.060
So I'm not going to go back to summarise, because the people who have listened to the previous thing can continue on the next.

3
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:36.360
So, Louisa said, "My Jesus disappeared, and I remained more embittered, thinking about the ugly, vertiginous race of creatures, that is the headlong race into chaos and nothingness."

4
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:39.360
Okay.

5
00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:44.460
And about the turmoil which nature will cause against them.

6
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:50.060
Now, we're already living at that stage where nature is rebelling against the human race.

7
00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:55.760
Then, as I returned to prayer, my Jesus came back in a pitiful state.

8
00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:59.760
He seemed restless, he was moaning, and he was grieving.

9
00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:05.720
He laid himself within me, and would turn now to the right, and then to the left.

10
00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:17.060
I asked him, "Jesus, my love, what's wrong? Please, you suffer too much. Let us share the pains. Do not want to be alone."

11
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:23.360
So, don't you see how much you suffer, and that you can take no more.

12
00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:29.660
So, while I was saying this, I found myself outside of myself in the arms of a priest.

13
00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:33.360
So she's in her out-of-the-body experience, okay?

14
00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:40.160
However, while the person seemed to be a priest, it seemed to me that his voice was that of Jesus.

15
00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:49.460
So, I want to give you Hebrews 4, 14 to 16. Jesus is our great high priest.

16
00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:55.560
And he said to me, "We will cover an extremely long way. Be attentive to what you see."

17
00:01:55.560 --> 00:02:02.060
And while we were walking without touching the ground, that's typical of out-of-the-body.

18
00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:09.660
First, I was carrying him in my arms, but since a dog was following him, that's Satan tagging along,

19
00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:18.960
but he can't actually stop the work. Many people don't realize that a dog is a symbol of Satan.

20
00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:24.360
They know that the pig is a symbol of Satan, but they don't actually know that a dog is,

21
00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:29.660
and that he can come and manifest a presence through a dog.

22
00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:34.260
You will recognize that if it happens to you.

23
00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:40.760
But since a dog was following me, as if it wanted to bite me, I was afraid.

24
00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:46.060
Now, notice that the satanic presence wants to attack the human.

25
00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.860
He can't touch the divine. He can't touch the divine will.

26
00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.060
Is that okay? So he tries to attack the human.

27
00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:59.860
And he also attacked Jesus in the wilderness as well, in Matthew 4 and Luke 4, okay?

28
00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:07.760
But that was because he was dealing with Jesus in his humanity.

29
00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:11.460
So to free me from fear, we changed position, and he carried me.

30
00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:15.260
You remember the footsteps?

31
00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:18.760
Yeah, that the Lord carries us when we're in trouble.

32
00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:23.060
I said to him, "Why did you not do it before? You caused me to be scared."

33
00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:29.760
Now, notice she's blaming him, but I didn't say anything because I thought it was necessary that I carry you.

34
00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:37.160
Now, I am content because as I'm carried in your arms, it will not be able to do anything to me anymore.

35
00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:43.260
Sam 23, "The Lord is my shepherd. There is nothing I shall want."

36
00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:48.260
And I kept saying, "Jesus is carrying me in his arms."

37
00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.760
And he would repeat, "That should be a capital H."

38
00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:55.960
He would repeat, "I'm saying Jesus is in my arms."

39
00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.260
She said, "Jesus is in my arms."

40
00:03:58.260 --> 00:04:00.560
He said, "Jesus is in my arms."

41
00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:03.960
So it didn't matter whether she carried him or he carried her.

42
00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:06.060
Why? Because they are one.

43
00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.360
Okay.

44
00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:09.960
But that dog followed our whole journey.

45
00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:18.860
Now, that dog has been following the whole history of the human race and trying to interrupt and destroy what God is doing.

46
00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:24.760
Only it kept one of my feet in its mouth, but without biting it.

47
00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:29.560
In other words, he tries to keep a grip on a situation.

48
00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:30.460
It's very interesting.

49
00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:38.060
When you consider the height that Louisa has reached and that Satan can still get a grip on our foot,

50
00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:42.060
even in this out-of-the-body experience, because I mean, he's a spirit.

51
00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:44.060
