52
00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:47.660
But without biting it because she was in Jesus' arms.

53
00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:52.960
The journey was long, and I often asked, "How much more do we have left?"

54
00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:56.260
And he said, "One hundred more miles."

55
00:04:56.260 --> 00:05:02.360
And then I asked again, he said, "30 more," and so on, until we arrived in the city.

56
00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:10.060
Now, it seems to me from the context that the city is wrong.

57
00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:12.060
Okay.

58
00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:19.260
And now, who can say what can be seen along the way?

59
00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:25.860
